cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ev-flow in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ev-flow: synthetic plug-in electric vehicle charging data"
abstract: >-
  ev-flow generates synthetic plug-in electric vehicle charging behaviour
  grounded in NHTS 2017 travel micro-data and a regional vehicle sales-mix
  model. It is distributed on PyPI as "ev-flow" and imported in Python as
  "pev_synth".
authors:
  - given-names: Bertrand
    family-names: Travacca
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7167-7455"
    email: bertrand.travacca@gmail.com
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bertravacca/ev-flow"
url: "https://github.com/bertravacca/ev-flow"
keywords:
  - electric vehicles
  - EV charging
  - synthetic data
  - energy
  - power grid
  - NHTS
